<title>SAN MARINO: TENNIS-SAN MARINO MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SAN MARINO MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MARINO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results of the</p>
<p>$300,000 San Marino men's clay court tournament on Thursday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>4-Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Hernan Gumy (Argentina) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Carlos Costa (Spain) beat Renzo Furlan (Italy) 5-7 6-3 6-3</p>
</text>
